# mggate.msg - the main gate of Megaton (mggate.ssl). One entry per line.

{100}{}{You see the gate of Megaton.}
{101}{}{Two slabs of plate on a rail, MEGA stenciled on one and TON on the other, under the wing of some airliner. The jet engine hanging from it is the tired motor that hauls them apart.}
# 102 used while shut, 103 it opens, 104 lockpick, 105 used while open.
{102}{}{The gate does not move. There is no handle, no latch, and nobody on this side of it who looks like a doorman. The robot, perhaps.}
{103}{}{With a groan of old hydraulics, the gate of Megaton grinds open.}
{104}{}{There is no lock to pick. The gate opens when the deputy says so.}
{105}{}{The gate stays open. Megaton likes to watch its visitors leave.}
